```typescript
// (1) INTERPOLATION: one-way component -> view (display).
<p>Hello, {{ name }}</p>

// (2) PROPERTY BINDING: one-way component -> view (set a property).
<img [src]="user.avatarUrl" [alt]="user.name">   // sets DOM attributes

// (3) EVENT BINDING: one-way view -> component (react).
<button (click)="save()">Save</button>
<input (input)="onInput($event)">

// (4) TWO-WAY BINDING: both directions (sync an input with a property).
<input [(ngModel)]="name">     // name updates when typing; input shows name
//   [(ngModel)] is sugar for [ngModel]="name" (ngModelChange)="name=$event".
```
